WEBVTT

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.700
<i>Dad?</i>

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:15.610
<i>Mom?</i>

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:23.330
<i>Big Brother...</i>

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:25.460
<i>Big Brother!</i>

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:31.300
<i>Huh?</i>

00:00:36.260 --> 00:00:38.390
<i>Help... Help me!</i>

00:00:39.760 --> 00:00:41.770
<i>Big Brother!</i>

00:00:53.990 --> 00:00:55.820
I'm fine.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:59.870
Dad, Mom, Kanna...

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:03.250
I still remember you.

00:01:15.260 --> 00:01:18.180
Man, this won't peel off!

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:56.860
<i>This is an order from headquarters!</i>

00:02:57.150 --> 00:02:59.240
<i>Make sure to retrieve the core at any cost!</i>

00:02:59.820 --> 00:03:00.950
<i>That's all.</i>

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:11.920
<i>That's why I warned you that it would be
a mission a human couldn't manage, right?</i>

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:13.250
H-Help me!

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.500
<i>The contract I presented to you
the other day...</i>

00:03:15.840 --> 00:03:18.630
<i>Have you made considerations about it?</i>

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:20.800
<i>Depending on your soul's budget,</i>

00:03:20.800 --> 00:03:24.550
<i>we have prepared three plans
from B-Class to D-Class.</i>

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:26.970
Give me the most powerful one!

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:29.140
THANK YOU
FOR YOUR CONTRACT

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:39.900
EPISODE 3
THE SLIGHTEST TERRIBLE COST

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.320
HEADLINE - TODAY
CATEGORY: LOCAL NEWS

00:03:38.730 --> 00:03:40.320
LARGE SCALE BLACKOUTS
IN BAYRON CITY

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:41.070
IS THE PLANT INCIDENT
THE CAUSE OF THE
LARGE-SCALE BLACKOUT
IN BAYRON CITY?

00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:43.530
It's strange that the entire town
is out of power.

00:03:44.110 --> 00:03:48.040
Maybe the world's finally caught up to us?

00:03:49.620 --> 00:03:51.870
It looks like the trains aren't moving either.

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:54.170
I wonder if I'll be able to go to school.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:59.420
MR. SHU OGATA

00:04:01.590 --> 00:04:03.340
- It looks like...
- Huh?

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:07.220
...you don't have time
to be going to school right now.

00:04:10.640 --> 00:04:12.060
Hayato Atsumi.

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:15.480
A worker at North Plant,
the site of the Hazard.

00:04:15.480 --> 00:04:23.740
That said, our investigation has proven that
said individual has already died three years ago.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:28.080
Affiliation: Byron Scientific Lab
North Plant

00:04:24.070 --> 00:04:28.080
That means it's highly likely
he's a spy from another country.

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:31.500
Is he after the technology
to refine Orgonium?

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:34.040
Yes, almost definitely.

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:35.290
Huh? What do you mean?

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:37.790
Um, let's see...

00:04:38.960 --> 00:04:44.180
Father, as you know, Bayron City was built with
the objective of mining and researching Orgonium,

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:47.430
a next generation energy resource.

00:04:47.850 --> 00:04:51.680
Oh, that was in the manuscript
for my speech the other day.

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:56.560
State-of-the-art Orgonium-related technology
created in this City is an important secret

00:04:56.560 --> 00:05:00.110
that's desperately sought after
by other nations.

00:05:00.110 --> 00:05:05.990
Enough for over 30 spies
to be sent here in the past five years!

00:05:06.410 --> 00:05:10.530
I-It's turned into that big a deal?
When did that happen?

00:05:12.660 --> 00:05:17.370
And one of those spies lashed out
and made a mess, creating this Demon Hazard.

00:05:17.370 --> 00:05:20.670
So we're talking about
how we're going to deal with it, Chief?

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:24.920
When it comes
to a Demon Hazard of this caliber,

00:05:24.920 --> 00:05:28.340
we can't keep the media shut down
with just the police.

00:05:28.720 --> 00:05:31.260
Is that what the director general
ordered you to tell us?

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:34.520
Oh no, um...

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:36.480
It's fine.

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:39.980
Nothing starts unless we mobilize anyway.

00:05:39.980 --> 00:05:40.980
Linfa...

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:42.570
I know!

00:05:42.860 --> 00:05:48.070
I'll personally show you
a cover-up at the city level.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.700
U-Um...

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:56.290
What about me?

00:05:56.290 --> 00:05:58.370
Oh, I'd forgotten.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:04.920
None of the departments
will mobilize without that.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.130
It's an important job, okay, Father?

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:12.810
Anyway, that's how it is.

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:18.350
Bayron City Mayor

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:18.350
BAYRON CITY SPECIAL HAZARD
CERTIFICATION APPLICATION

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:18.350
We hereby acknowledge by a special law that an explosion,
 as well as a large-scale blackout,
 occurred in Bayron City Plant earlier today as a D Hazard,
and we approve taking measures against it.

00:06:14.970 --> 00:06:18.350
Site Manager

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.350
HACHISUKA

00:06:19.560 --> 00:06:21.270
I get it, I get it!

00:06:22.060 --> 00:06:23.480
Your work or your girl!

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:27.280
You always run into that problem
when you fall in love, right?

00:06:27.820 --> 00:06:32.450
I may sound really coldhearted for saying this,
but you're the one making the decision.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:36.040
I can only support you
with whatever decision you make.

00:06:36.700 --> 00:06:40.170
But yes, the most powerful support.

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:46.260
So, why did you take the effort
to call me all the way out here?

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:49.590
Well, my entire neighborhood has no power.

00:06:49.840 --> 00:06:51.430
Really?

00:06:51.430 --> 00:06:55.060
The condos and companies over here
don't look that way at all.

00:06:55.310 --> 00:07:00.100
In the end, Old Town suffers
from the deficiency of electrical power, huh?

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:02.190
Hate it. Hate being poor.

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:04.690
Enough of your gripes.
Just tell me your business.

00:07:05.770 --> 00:07:10.450
I snuck out of work to come here,
so I want you to get it over with quickly.

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:13.450
This may be a silly question...

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:16.330
but what kind of work
are you doing in that outfit?

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:20.210
I-I changed in a hurry
because this place is what it is!

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:23.670
Oh, I'm sorry I made you
feel so considerate toward me!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:27.960
Ayano?

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:31.630
Enough small talk.
Just tell me your business.

00:07:34.220 --> 00:07:38.600
It's a B-Rank because it's huge,
but it moves slowly.

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:41.390
Kisara and I will be
more than enough to handle it.

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:45.020
Are you going to hunt
this caterpillar down?

00:07:45.360 --> 00:07:46.650
Look at this one.

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:49.940
This emblem...

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:54.820
Yep. It's the same one as the one
from the casino. This one is my prey.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:57.490
Where and when was this taken?

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:00.830
I heard it was taken
this morning at North Plant.

00:08:01.330 --> 00:08:05.750
The auction correspondence
should come within an hour.

00:08:05.750 --> 00:08:12.970
Such detailed information came
before the auction to a tiny company like you...

00:08:13.260 --> 00:08:18.510
It just means there are bureaucrats who're deeply
concerned about the existence of demons, right?

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:21.480
Shu, do you really understand?
That means...

00:08:22.100 --> 00:08:23.440
Yeah.

00:08:23.440 --> 00:08:28.440
Someone's taking advantage of my circumstances
and exploiting on my willingness to do this job.

00:08:28.940 --> 00:08:35.280
Though to be more precise, I think
they're trying to exploit Kisara's powers.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:37.950
You know that, but why do you...

00:08:38.280 --> 00:08:39.580
Of course it's because...

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:46.080
I need info from this guy to fulfill my objective
even if this is what it takes.

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:52.920
So please go tell your boss.

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:56.430
I'll take this job, no matter what.

00:08:56.760 --> 00:08:59.430
Information leak and collusion.

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:01.220
One dishonest act after another.

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:03.140
What are you talking about after all this?

00:09:03.140 --> 00:09:06.150
You were fully aware
of everything, as well, Ayano.

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:07.270
That's...

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:10.190
But believe me.

00:09:11.030 --> 00:09:15.650
I've never betrayed your expectations
to this day, have I?

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:22.200
You didn't tell me you were going
to a dating party when we were going out.

00:09:22.200 --> 00:09:25.210
The whereabouts of the $3,000
became obscured before I knew it.

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:29.630
You didn't come home on my birthday.
You quit our company without consulting me.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:33.760
And you made a demon girl your partner.
Other than that, no. Oh, wait, and—

00:09:33.760 --> 00:09:36.180
I'm sorry!
I've betrayed you a whole lot!

00:09:36.510 --> 00:09:39.640
But see, you can chalk it up
to the rashness of one's youth!

00:09:40.050 --> 00:09:42.640
I've changed. I really have!

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:46.890
The winning bid is $200,000.

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:48.150
The winner of this auction is...

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:51.820
I&S Office.

00:09:52.270 --> 00:09:54.530
You're kidding me!
This is a B-Class, right?

00:09:54.530 --> 00:09:57.450
Normally, this job would cost
at least 500,000!

00:09:57.780 --> 00:10:00.530
If stupid price wars like this continue,

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:03.580
small and medium-sized companies
like us can't stay in business!

00:10:03.990 --> 00:10:06.500
Everyone, can I have a moment?

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.880
The auction that just ended...

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:15.010
has been canceled due to an important
new piece of information coming into light.

00:10:15.510 --> 00:10:16.590
Huh?

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:22.300
What's this?

00:10:22.850 --> 00:10:26.640
The newest image as of 11 AM today.

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:30.400
This information has been provided to us
by JADEITE Company.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:32.690
What's that point of light
near its heart?

00:10:33.150 --> 00:10:37.990
An Orgonium core
that was being refined in North Plant.

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:42.740
It's highly concentrated energy that can provide
a week's worth of electricity to the entire City.

00:10:43.660 --> 00:10:48.830
Are you saying it swallowed
a week's worth of this city's electricity?

00:10:49.330 --> 00:10:52.750
That core must be retrieved at any cost.

00:10:53.170 --> 00:10:57.090
Therefore, the target's death
or destruction is prohibited.

00:10:57.090 --> 00:11:00.300
Please bid once again
with the additional condition

00:11:00.300 --> 00:11:03.760
that its apprehension
in its original state is top priority.

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:06.100
No way!

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:07.270
Hold on!

00:11:08.020 --> 00:11:12.440
I'm terribly sorry, but now that the conditions
of the auction have changed,

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:15.400
we must nullify
the winning bid from earlier.

00:11:14.150 --> 00:11:17.070
I'll take on the additional conditions, too!
And I'll keep my bid the same!

00:11:17.360 --> 00:11:18.240
So let me—

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:25.030
Do you have the means
to capture that big thing whole?

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:34.500
Looks like that caterpillar isn't moving at all.

00:11:35.170 --> 00:11:38.010
That's convenient for us though.

00:11:41.430 --> 00:11:45.050
We've completed the evacuation
of all residents in a one-kilometer radius.

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:46.720
Thank you for all your hard work.

00:11:47.060 --> 00:11:48.220
What are you looking at?

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:51.850
I was reading the details of this auction.

00:11:52.190 --> 00:11:56.980
Officer Morgan, you were acquaintances
with this individual named "Shu Ogata," right?

00:11:57.610 --> 00:11:59.240
Well, yes.

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:03.320
He had a lot going on
when he was young.

00:12:03.660 --> 00:12:06.490
I was his foster parent for about a year.

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:13.460
And now he's the strongest Demon Exterminator
and the only demon-user in this city, huh?

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:18.750
Well, actually, that has something to do with
what was going on around him as I said earlier.

00:12:19.420 --> 00:12:21.970
I'm not blaming you for anything.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:24.510
Actually, he's the hero of this city.

00:12:25.140 --> 00:12:28.890
Without him and the demon girl
he totes with him,

00:12:28.890 --> 00:12:32.140
the order of this city
would've deteriorated long ago.

00:12:32.690 --> 00:12:35.520
Well, it's true that the police is useless,

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:38.150
especially for Demon Extermination.

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:40.070
BAYRON CITY SPECIAL LAW 99 ARTICLES

00:12:38.150 --> 00:12:42.000
PURPOSE

00:12:39.360 --> 00:12:42.440
Thanks to the Heavy Weapons Act
forced onto us by other countries

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:47.000
FIRING PROHIBITION

00:12:42.440 --> 00:12:44.860
that feared the independence of the City.

00:12:44.860 --> 00:12:46.200
That's especially why...

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:50.660
he and his partner are the strongest force
of the City, even surpassing that of the police.

00:12:47.000 --> 00:12:50.660
OPEN CARRY PROHIBITION

00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:55.540
And yet, the bureaucrats and others in
the same business all treat him as an annoyance

00:12:55.540 --> 00:12:57.330
and exclude him from bidding.

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:03.800
Even if poison is used
to keep control of other poison,

00:13:03.800 --> 00:13:06.260
it's still poison nonetheless.

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:15.940
Freezing artillery has hit!

00:13:16.350 --> 00:13:18.690
- Succeeded in nullifying the target!
- All right!

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:25.700
Looks like they'll make something of this.

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:28.030
We first immobilize the target!

00:13:28.030 --> 00:13:30.450
Then, we'll move to the extraction of the core!

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:33.410
From here on, it's a race against time!

00:13:35.330 --> 00:13:39.340
Shu brought that demon girl
back to the City two years ago.

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:44.920
He immediately applied for registration as a Demon
Extermination Business with the government.

00:13:45.260 --> 00:13:47.680
It didn't go through that easily?

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:50.300
It wasn't anything like that.

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:55.520
The government decided to designate them
as the first A-Class Demon Hazard in history.

00:13:56.480 --> 00:14:01.650
As a result of the auction,
the industry leader AAA bowed out

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:05.690
FORFEIT

00:14:01.650 --> 00:14:05.690
and every other company formed
a Joint Venture to deal with them. But...

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:09.160
They were defeated instead?

00:14:09.160 --> 00:14:11.780
Yes. Wiped out completely.

00:14:12.240 --> 00:14:17.620
Based on that incident, the government
begrudgingly decided to authorize Shu's company

00:14:17.960 --> 00:14:21.420
because they realized they couldn't win
if they sided against him.

00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:25.010
I see. That would cause
quite a bit of discord.

00:14:36.730 --> 00:14:38.020
What is that?

00:14:38.020 --> 00:14:39.350
What's going on?

00:14:46.610 --> 00:14:48.570
That's impossible!

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:50.990
I see. A caterpillar indeed.

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:54.830
I see. So for that giant thing
to thrash about as much as it wanted,

00:14:54.830 --> 00:14:58.120
it needed to take time for its emergence.

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:01.080
<i>I didn't want to hear
such an explanation in hindsight!</i>

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:04.210
<i>What we want is the next move from here!</i>

00:15:04.210 --> 00:15:05.380
What about a spare unit?

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:08.130
No way can we deploy one!
We're already deep in debt!

00:15:08.130 --> 00:15:09.720
What are you going to do about this?

00:15:10.430 --> 00:15:11.720
There you have it.

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:14.680
There is a possibility
an additional budget may be passed,

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:17.220
but I can't make a decision
here on the spot.

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:19.940
<i>Why don't you come onsite
and tell that to everyone here!</i>

00:15:20.480 --> 00:15:21.690
Ayano...

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:28.320
Hold out for five minutes.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:30.200
SHU OGATA

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:35.580
It looks like you guys are in trouble.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:36.950
<i>I'm busy, so I'll hang up now.</i>

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:38.790
Hold on just a minute!

00:15:40.500 --> 00:15:41.250
Roll out!

00:16:01.850 --> 00:16:05.110
I thought at least you would fend for me.

00:16:05.440 --> 00:16:07.730
<i>There was nothing I could do back there.</i>

00:16:07.730 --> 00:16:10.530
<i>It's all because of your attitude until now.</i>

00:16:11.650 --> 00:16:15.530
<i>Now that you've joined society,
you have to face it fair and square.</i>

00:16:15.530 --> 00:16:20.080
Why do I have to do so
with those guys with no power,

00:16:20.080 --> 00:16:22.580
no determination,
and most of all no hatred?

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:26.540
<i>Anyway, Ayano's squad
is barely holding it back.</i>

00:16:22.580 --> 00:16:28.710
AYANO YUGIRI

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:28.050
<i>But they won't last long.</i>

00:16:29.460 --> 00:16:31.260
We have to do something about this.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:34.470
Even if we borrowed
the powers of a demon.

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:38.390
- Chief Ashiya...
- Huh?

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:43.890
You're not so leisurely now as to continue
asserting we need to retrieve the core, are you?

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:45.150
Ayano Yugiri
Contractor: I&S Office
Representative: Shu Ogata

00:16:43.890 --> 00:16:45.150
CONTRACT

00:16:49.570 --> 00:16:51.820
That one's a bit troublesome.

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:54.740
Looks like we have to go at full strength.

00:16:55.160 --> 00:16:56.490
Are we going to?

00:16:56.490 --> 00:16:57.870
Of course.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:01.330
Then, where are you going to give me?

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:04.870
I think I haven't touched anything
from three years ago.

00:17:05.210 --> 00:17:07.290
Three years ago?

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:10.210
One month. No, that's not enough.

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:11.670
Three months.

00:17:11.670 --> 00:17:14.260
Let's see. How about springtime?

00:17:14.590 --> 00:17:17.010
You know what happened back then?

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:20.390
I might not remember from now on.

00:17:20.850 --> 00:17:24.520
That was when you started
living together with her, right?

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:26.560
I don't care.

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:28.650
Because I made up my mind.

00:17:28.650 --> 00:17:33.400
I don't care what else I lose
if I can fulfill my objective.

00:17:33.690 --> 00:17:35.530
What's your objective?

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:37.660
The annihilation of demons?

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:40.330
To bring your family back? Or...

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:43.790
is it to save her from the dangerous situation

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:46.330
right in front of your eyes now?

00:17:47.040 --> 00:17:48.920
Shu, did you realize...

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:52.250
that the outfit Ayano was wearing earlier...

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:57.680
was the one she wore
on the first date with you?

00:17:57.930 --> 00:17:59.260
I see.

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:01.560
You didn't remember.

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:05.270
Of course not. Because that memory
is another one that I—

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:15.530
You're the worst guy ever.

00:18:15.820 --> 00:18:20.950
You're willing to embrace a woman
you don't love to get your objective.

00:18:22.450 --> 00:18:28.330
You even discard memories
of the woman you love so you can save her.

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:30.210
I don't care if I'm the worst guy.

00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:35.260
Kisara, you can suck out
all of my memories

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:38.010
and change them into your power.

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:44.100
Into your true power that shows
that giant doll is no match against you!

00:18:54.820 --> 00:18:56.360
Captain...

00:18:57.700 --> 00:18:58.900
Captain!

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:10.000
You...

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.040
You're in the way.

00:19:11.420 --> 00:19:13.460
Now? Or always?

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:16.130
Decide for yourself!

00:19:41.610 --> 00:19:43.990
AIM FOR KISARA

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:43.620
<i>I'm fine.</i>

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:45.620
<i>I still remember.</i>

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:50.120
<i>Hold on.</i>

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:51.870
<i>Why do I have to do...</i>

00:19:52.120 --> 00:19:53.210
<i>something like this?</i>

00:19:55.210 --> 00:19:59.050
<i>I may have partially forgotten
my objective, so why?</i>

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:02.590
<i>No.</i>

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:04.300
<i>Don't think.</i>

00:20:05.430 --> 00:20:08.560
<i>My past self's telling me to do this!</i>

00:20:09.020 --> 00:20:11.640
<i>I just have to believe in that!</i>

00:20:31.250 --> 00:20:32.500
Did he do it?

00:20:33.000 --> 00:20:34.500
That was unnecessary!

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:16.710
Two shots really do a number on me.

00:21:18.710 --> 00:21:22.760
Look there. In the end,
they have to completely rely on Shu.

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:24.800
I wonder.

00:21:24.800 --> 00:21:27.180
What's he giving up in return?

00:21:27.510 --> 00:21:28.350
Huh?

00:21:28.890 --> 00:21:34.390
Every Demonically Possessed we've apprehended
to date had always lost something.

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:39.860
Their abilities, a part of their bodies,
or their lives outright.

00:21:40.730 --> 00:21:42.110
If so...

00:21:42.780 --> 00:21:43.990
I wonder...

00:21:44.360 --> 00:21:47.030
what in the world he's losing.

00:23:20.960 --> 00:23:25.050
Do I have to show gratitude toward you?

00:23:25.050 --> 00:23:27.590
You can decide that for yourself.

00:23:27.920 --> 00:23:29.050
But...

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:31.550
But?

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:53.280
I have to apologize to you...

00:23:53.280 --> 00:23:55.030
I guess.

00:23:55.620 --> 00:24:00.040
EPISODE 4
UNOBTAINABLE LINGERING

00:23:56.790 --> 00:23:58.950
"Unobtainable Lingering."
